OL,3,GNEWSALickey Hills parking fees on way
OL,4,Aas others spared
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has criticised Birmingham City
OL,7,FCouncil for introducing parking charges
OL,8,Fat Lickey Hills Country Park while
OL,9,Fshelving similar proposals for Sutton
OL,10,FPark and Sheldon Country Park.
OL,12,FThe authority had proposed charges at
OL,13,Fthe three beauty spots to help cover
OL,14,Fmaintenance costs after it declared
OL,15,Fitself bankrupt in 2023, triggering a
OL,16,Fwave of anger.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
PN,35602
