OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1793813158
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSALickey Hills parking fees on way
OL,4,Aas others spared
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradley Thomas, Conservative MP for
OL,7,FBromsgrove, in Worcestershire, which
OL,8,Fborders Lickey Hills, said after the
OL,9,Flatest decision: "We're paying the
OL,10,Fprice for Birmingham City Council's
OL,11,Ffinancial mismanagement."
OL,13,FThe council said it had reconsidered
OL,14,Fthe "individual circumstances" of each
OL,15,Fpark and would progress plans only at
OL,16,FLickey Hills in the next few months.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
